cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this evaluation pipeline or the results it produces, please cite
  both this repository and the upstream CodeMixBench paper.
title: "CodeMixTax: reproducible local-LLM evaluation on the CodeMixBench Indic subset"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible, resumable evaluation harness that scores open-weight / local
  LLMs on the 18 CodeMixBench splits covering five Indian languages (Hindi,
  Bengali, Marathi, Tamil, Malayalam) across eight tasks (LID, POS, NER, SA, MT,
  MMLU, GSM8K, TruthfulQA). Metric implementations are ports of the upstream
  CodeMixBench reference code; inference is served locally via vLLM, an
  OpenAI-compatible endpoint, or Hugging Face transformers.
type: software
